   "q_en": "<p>Trapezium MNOP is shown in figure where MN || OP and length of parallel sides are 12 cm and 17 cm respectively. Find the length of diagonal PN of the trapezium if area of trapezium is 72.5 cm<sup>2</sup>.</p><p><img width=248 height=118 id=\"Picture 18\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p3147/image006.png\"></p>",
   "q_hi": "<p>&#2360;&#2350;&#2354;&#2350;&#2381;&#2348; MNOP &#2325;&#2379; &#2310;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340;&#2367; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2342;&#2352;&#2381;&#2358;&#2366;&#2351;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2332;&#2361;&#2366;&#2306; MN || OP &#2324;&#2352; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366;&#2306;&#2340;&#2352; &#2349;&#2369;&#2332;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2368; &#2354;&#2306;&#2348;&#2366;&#2312; &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350;&#2358;&#2307; 12 &#2360;&#2375;.&#2350;&#2368;. &#2324;&#2352; 17 &#2360;&#2375;.&#2350;&#2368;. &#2361;&#2376; | &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2360;&#2350;&#2354;&#2350;&#2381;&#2348; &#2325;&#2366; &#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2375;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2347;&#2354; 72.5 &#2360;&#2375;.&#2350;&#2368;.<sup>2</sup> &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2360;&#2350;&#2354;&#2350;&#2381;&#2348; &#2325;&#2375; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2339; PN &#2325;&#2368; &#2354;&#2306;&#2348;&#2366;&#2312; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306; |</p><p><img width=248 height=118 id=\"Picture 18\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p3147/image006.png\"></p>",
   "options_en": [
    "12 cm",
    "13 cm",
    "14 cm",
    "15 km"
   ],
   "options_hi": [
    "12 &#2360;&#2375;.&#2350;&#2368;.",
    "13 &#2360;&#2375;&#2350;&#2368;",
    "14 &#2360;&#2375;.&#2350;&#2368;.",
    "15 &#2360;&#2375;.&#2350;&#2368;."
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "solution_en": "<p>Draw a line NA perpendicular to OP.</p><p><img width=248 height=118 id=\"Picture 17\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p3147/image007.png\"></p><p>Area of trapezium = &frac12; * (Sum of parallel sides) * (Perpendicular distance between parallel sides)</p><p>=&gt; 72.5 = &frac12; * (12 + 17) * NA</p><p>=&gt; NA = 145/29 = 5 cm</p><p>MNAP is a rectangle-</p><p>=&gt; PN<sup>2</sup> = MN<sup>2</sup> + NA<sup>2</sup></p><p>=&gt; PN<sup>2</sup> = 12<sup>2</sup> + 5<sup>2</sup> = 144 + 25 = 169</p><p>=&gt; PN = 13 cm</p>",
   "solution_hi": "<p>Draw a line NA perpendicular to OP.</p><p><img width=248 height=118 id=\"Picture 17\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p3147/image007.png\"></p><p>Area of trapezium = &frac12; * (Sum of parallel sides) * (Perpendicular distance between parallel sides)</p><p>=&gt; 72.5 = &frac12; * (12 + 17) * NA</p><p>=&gt; NA = 145/29 = 5 cm</p><p>MNAP is a rectangle-</p><p>=&gt; PN<sup>2</sup> = MN<sup>2</sup> + NA<sup>2</sup></p><p>=&gt; PN<sup>2</sup> = 12<sup>2</sup> + 5<sup>2</sup> = 144 + 25 = 169</p><p>=&gt; PN = 13 cm</p>",
   "marks": 1.0,
   "neg": 0.25
