   "q_en": "<p>What is the value of &ang;COD if ABCD is a square with &ang;BEO = 55&deg; and E is the mid-point of side AB?</p><p><img width=158 height=125 id=\"Picture 17\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p3879/image003.jpg\"></p>",
   "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; ABCD &#2319;&#2325; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2327; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#8736;BEO = 55&deg; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; E &#2349;&#2369;&#2332;&#2366; AB &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2343;&#2381;&#2351; &#2348;&#2367;&#2306;&#2342;&#2369; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#8736;COD &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2366;?</p><p><img width=\"158\" height=\"125\" id=\"Picture 17\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p3879/image003.jpg\"></p>",
