   "solution_en": "<p>&#8736;BEO = &#8736;OCD = 55<sup>0</sup> [Alternate angles.]</p><p>In &#9651;OCD,</p><p>&#8736;OCD = 55<sup>0</sup></p><p>&#8736;ODC = 45<sup>0 </sup>[BD is the diameter.]</p><p>&#8736;OCD + &#8736;ODC + &#8736;COD = 180<sup>0</sup></p><p>55<sup>0</sup> + 45<sup>0</sup> + &#8736;COD = 180<sup>0</sup></p><p>&#8736;COD = 180<sup>0</sup>  -  (55<sup>0</sup> + 45<sup>0</sup>)</p><p>&#8736;COD = 80<sup>0</sup></p>",
