   "q_en": "<p>What is the length of the base of the parallelogram whose corresponding altitude is thrice the base and the area of the parallelogram is 147 cm&#178;?</p>",
   "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2306;&#2340;&#2352; &#2330;&#2340;&#2369;&#2352;&#2381;&#2349;&#2369;&#2332; &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2314;&#2306;&#2330;&#2366;&#2312;, &#2310;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2375; &#2340;&#2368;&#2344; &#2327;&#2369;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2306;&#2340;&#2352; &#2330;&#2340;&#2369;&#2352;&#2381;&#2349;&#2369;&#2332; &#2325;&#2366; &#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2375;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2347;&#2354; 147 &#2360;&#2375;&#2350;&#2368;&#178; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2306;&#2340;&#2352; &#2330;&#2340;&#2369;&#2352;&#2381;&#2349;&#2369;&#2332; &#2325;&#2375; &#2310;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2368; &#2354;&#2350;&#2381;&#2348;&#2366;&#2312; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>",
   "options_en": [
    "4 cm",
    "5 cm",
    "6 cm",
    "7 cm"
   ],
   "options_hi": [
    "4 &#2360;&#2375;.&#2350;&#2368;.",
    "5 &#2360;&#2375;.&#2350;&#2368;.",
    "6 &#2360;&#2375;.&#2350;&#2368;.",
    "7 &#2360;&#2375;.&#2350;&#2368;."
   ],
   "answer": 3,
   "solution_en": "<p>Let the base of the parallelogram be x cm.</p><p>&#8756; Height of the parallelogram = 3x cm.</p><p>Area of the parallelogram = x * 3x</p><p>=&gt; 3x&#178; = 147</p><p>=&gt; x&#178; = 49</p><p>=&gt; x = 7 cm</p>",
   "solution_hi": "<p>Let the base of the parallelogram be x cm.</p><p>&#8756; Height of the parallelogram = 3x cm.</p><p>Area of the parallelogram = x * 3x</p><p>=&gt; 3x&#178; = 147</p><p>=&gt; x&#178; = 49</p><p>=&gt; x = 7 cm</p>",
   "marks": 1.0,
   "neg": 0.25
