   "q_en": "<p>If a 30-sided polygon is transformed into a 13-sided polygon, then the sum of interior angles of 30-sided polygon is reduced by</p>",
   "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2319;&#2325; 30-&#2349;&#2369;&#2332;&#2366; &#2357;&#2366;&#2354;&#2375; &#2348;&#2361;&#2369;&#2349;&#2369;&#2332; &#2325;&#2379; 13-&#2349;&#2369;&#2332;&#2366; &#2357;&#2366;&#2354;&#2375; &#2348;&#2361;&#2369;&#2349;&#2369;&#2332; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2352;&#2367;&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2340;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; 30-&#2349;&#2369;&#2332;&#2366; &#2357;&#2366;&#2354;&#2375; &#2348;&#2361;&#2369;&#2349;&#2369;&#2332; &#2325;&#2375; &#2310;&#2306;&#2340;&#2352;&#2367;&#2325; &#2325;&#2379;&#2339;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2351;&#2379;&#2327; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2325;&#2350; &#2361;&#2379; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>",
   "options_en": [
    "1980&deg;",
    "3060&deg;",
    "4842&deg;",
    "5475&deg;"
   ],
   "options_hi": [
    "1980<sup>o</sup>",
    "3060<sup>o</sup>",
    "4842<sup>o</sup>",
    "5475<sup>o</sup>"
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "solution_en": "<p>According to the Question,</p><p>If N is the number of sides of the polygon, then sum of its interior angles = (N-2) x 180<sup>o</sup></p><p>Sum of interior angles of 30-sided polygon = (30-2) x 180<sup>o </sup>= 5040<sup>o</sup></p><p>Sum of interior angles of 13-sided polygon = (13-2) x 180<sup>o </sup>= 1980<sup>o</sup></p><p>If a 30-sided polygon is transformed into a 13-sided polygon, then the sum of interior angles of 30-sided polygon is reduced by = Sum of interior angles of 30-sided polygon - Sum of interior angles of 13-sided polygon</p><p>= 5040<sup>o</sup>  -  1980<sup>o</sup></p><p>=3060<sup>o </sup>Ans.</p>",
   "solution_hi": "<p>According to the Question,</p><p>If N is the number of sides of the polygon, then sum of its interior angles = (N-2) x 180<sup>o</sup></p><p>Sum of interior angles of 30-sided polygon = (30-2) x 180<sup>o </sup>= 5040<sup>o</sup></p><p>Sum of interior angles of 13-sided polygon = (13-2) x 180<sup>o </sup>= 1980<sup>o</sup></p><p>If a 30-sided polygon is transformed into a 13-sided polygon, then the sum of interior angles of 30-sided polygon is reduced by = Sum of interior angles of 30-sided polygon - Sum of interior angles of 13-sided polygon</p><p>= 5040<sup>o</sup>  -  1980<sup>o</sup></p><p>=3060<sup>o </sup>Ans.</p>",
