   "q_en": "<p>In a parallelogram, ratio of length and breadth is 9: 7. If distance between bigger sides is 21 cm and area of parallelogram is 1100 cm<sup>2</sup><sub>,</sub> find distance between shorter sides.</p>",
   "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2306;&#2340;&#2352; &#2330;&#2340;&#2369;&#2352;&#2381;&#2349;&#2369;&#2332; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2354;&#2306;&#2348;&#2366;&#2312; &#2324;&#2352; &#2330;&#2380;&#2337;&#2364;&#2366;&#2312; &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2346;&#2366;&#2340; 9:7 &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2348;&#2337;&#2364;&#2368; &#2349;&#2369;&#2332;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2368;&#2330; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2370;&#2352;&#2368; 21 &#2360;&#2375;&#2350;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2306;&#2340;&#2352; &#2330;&#2340;&#2369;&#2352;&#2381;&#2349;&#2369;&#2332; &#2325;&#2366; &#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2375;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2347;&#2354; 1100 &#2360;&#2375;&#2350;&#2368;<sup>2</sup> &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2331;&#2379;&#2335;&#2368; &#2349;&#2369;&#2332;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2368;&#2330; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2370;&#2352;&#2368; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>",
