   "solution_en": "<p><img width=227 height=140 id=\"Picture 7\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p14037/image005.jpg\"></p><p>Area = l*h<sub>1</sub> = b*h<sub>2</sub></p><p>=> l/b = h<sub>2</sub>/h<sub>1</sub></p><p>=> h<sub>2</sub>/h<sub>1 </sub>= 9/7</p><p>=> h<sub>2</sub> = 9/7 * 21 = 27 cm</p>",
