   "solution_en": "<p><img width=213 height=110 id=\"Picture 22\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p19066/image018.jpg\"></p><p>Diagonal, AC = 2.4 cm and BD = 1.5 cm</p><p>AO = AC/2 = 2.4/2</p><p>BO = BD/2 = 1.5/2</p><p>Side of rhombus = AB</p><p>Since, diagonals of a rhombus are perpendicular to each other.</p><p>In triangle AOB, AB<sup>2 </sup>= AO<sup>2 </sup>+ OB<sup>2</sup></p><p><img width=117 height=23 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p19066/image019.png\"></p><p><img width=151 height=48 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p19066/image020.png\"></p><p>= <img width=101 height=36 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p19066/image021.png\"></p><p>= <img width=56 height=36 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p19066/image022.png\"></p><p>=<img width=53 height=36 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p19066/image023.png\"></p><p>= <img width=23 height=21 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p19066/image024.png\"></p><p>So, perimeter of rhombus = <img width=32 height=21 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p19066/image025.png\">cm</p>",
   "solution_hi": "<p><img width=213 height=110 id=\"Picture 22\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p19066/image018.jpg\"></p><p>Diagonal, AC = 2.4 cm and BD = 1.5 cm</p><p>AO = AC/2 = 2.4/2</p><p>BO = BD/2 = 1.5/2</p><p>Side of rhombus = AB</p><p>Since, diagonals of a rhombus are perpendicular to each other.</p><p>In triangle AOB, AB<sup>2 </sup>= AO<sup>2 </sup>+ OB<sup>2</sup></p><p><img width=117 height=23 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p19066/image019.png\"></p><p><img width=151 height=48 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p19066/image020.png\"></p><p>= <img width=101 height=36 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p19066/image021.png\"></p><p>= <img width=56 height=36 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p19066/image022.png\"></p><p>=<img width=53 height=36 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p19066/image023.png\"></p><p>= <img width=23 height=21 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p19066/image024.png\"></p><p>So, perimeter of rhombus = <img width=32 height=21 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p19066/image025.png\">cm</p>",
