   "q_en": "<p>What is the ratio of the number of sides of polygon whose sum of interior angles is 4500&deg; to the polygon whose sum of interior angles is 720&deg;?</p>",
   "q_hi": "<p>&#2310;&#2306;&#2340;&#2352;&#2367;&#2325; &#2325;&#2379;&#2339;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2351;&#2379;&#2327;&#2347;&#2354; 4500<sup>o</sup> &#2357;&#2366;&#2354;&#2375; &#2348;&#2361;&#2369;&#2349;&#2369;&#2332; &#2325;&#2368; &#2349;&#2369;&#2332;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2340;&#2341;&#2366; &#2310;&#2306;&#2340;&#2352;&#2367;&#2325; &#2325;&#2379;&#2339;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2351;&#2379;&#2327;&#2347;&#2354; 720<sup>o</sup> &#2357;&#2366;&#2354;&#2375; &#2342;&#2370;&#2360;&#2352;&#2368; &#2348;&#2361;&#2369;&#2349;&#2369;&#2332; &#2325;&#2368; &#2349;&#2369;&#2332;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2346;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>",
   "options_en": [
    "25:4",
    "9:2",
    "27:2",
    "9:4"
   ],
   "options_hi": [
    "25:4",
    "9:2",
    "27:2",
    "9:4"
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "solution_en": "<p>According to the Question,</p><p>If N is the number of sides of the polygon, then sum of its interior angles = (N-2) x 180&deg;</p><p>Now, number of sides of polygon whose sum of interior angles is 4500&deg; = (N&#173;&#173;<sub>1</sub>-2) x 180&deg;</p><p>N&#173;&#173;<sub>1</sub> = (4500/180) +2</p><p>N&#173;&#173;<sub>1</sub>=25+2 = 27 sides</p><p>And, number of sides of polygon whose sum of interior angles is 720&deg; = (N<sub>2</sub>-2) x 180&deg;</p><p>N&#173;&#173;<sub>2</sub> = (720/180) +2</p><p>N&#173;&#173;<sub>2</sub> =4+2 = 6 sides</p><p>To find the ratio of number of sides of polygon whose sum of interior angles is 4500&deg; to the polygon whose sum of interior angles is 720&deg; = N<sup>&#173;</sup><sub>1</sub>/N<sub>2</sub> = 27/6 = 9/2 = 9:2 Ans.</p>",
   "solution_hi": "<p>According to the Question,</p><p>If N is the number of sides of the polygon, then sum of its interior angles = (N-2) x 180&deg;</p><p>Now, number of sides of polygon whose sum of interior angles is 4500&deg; = (N&#173;&#173;<sub>1</sub>-2) x 180&deg;</p><p>N&#173;&#173;<sub>1</sub> = (4500/180) +2</p><p>N&#173;&#173;<sub>1</sub>=25+2 = 27 sides</p><p>And, number of sides of polygon whose sum of interior angles is 720&deg; = (N<sub>2</sub>-2) x 180&deg;</p><p>N&#173;&#173;<sub>2</sub> = (720/180) +2</p><p>N&#173;&#173;<sub>2</sub> =4+2 = 6 sides</p><p>To find the ratio of number of sides of polygon whose sum of interior angles is 4500&deg; to the polygon whose sum of interior angles is 720&deg; = N<sup>&#173;</sup><sub>1</sub>/N<sub>2</sub> = 27/6 = 9/2 = 9:2 Ans.</p>",
