   "q_en": "<p>The ratio of number of sides of two regular polygons is 2:3. If the sum of one polygon's interior angles is added to the sum of the other polygon's interior angles, then the added value will be 1080&deg;. The measures of their exterior angles are  - </p>",
   "q_hi": "<p>&#2342;&#2379; &#2360;&#2350; &#2360;&#2350;&#2348;&#2361;&#2369;&#2349;&#2369;&#2332;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2368; &#2349;&#2369;&#2332;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2346;&#2366;&#2340; 2:3 &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2319;&#2325; &#2348;&#2361;&#2369;&#2349;&#2369;&#2332; &#2325;&#2375; &#2309;&#2306;&#2340;: &#2325;&#2379;&#2339;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2351;&#2379;&#2327;, &#2342;&#2370;&#2360;&#2352;&#2375; &#2348;&#2361;&#2369;&#2349;&#2369;&#2332; &#2325;&#2375; &#2309;&#2306;&#2340;: &#2325;&#2379;&#2339;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2351;&#2379;&#2327; &#2360;&#2375; &#2332;&#2379;&#2337;&#2364;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2332;&#2379;&#2337;&#2364;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; 1080&deg; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2366;&#2404; &#2313;&#2344;&#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2361;&#2367;&#2325;&#2379;&#2339;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2350;&#2366;&#2346; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306; -</p>",
   "options_en": [
    "80&deg;, 60",
    "90&deg;, 45&deg;",
